// Clue-object 3: containment versus catalysis.
// In the Shade Pool its darkness lets Grey Guppies breed Shadow Guppies (catalysis: the guppies keep).
// Crushed into a waxed pouch it becomes Smoke-In-A-Bag (containment), which opens the Balance (catalysis: stays open).
// Restoring the pearl from its husk makes only the bag inert.
{
