        "confirm": "The pearl will crack, and whatever is inside will go into the pouch. Its outer half will be left behind as a remnant (the Circle could make the pearl whole again).",
        "text": "The skin parts at last, and out pours a slow grey smoke that will not disperse, straight into the waxed pouch. You draw the cord tight. The pearl's dull outer half rolls on the bench, hollow as an eggshell.",
